{"slug":"Universal-Script-Universal-Timebomb-Script-195365","_id":"69d767f8a5f72a3c5de7d7e5","title":"Universal Timebomb Script","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"A universal and open-source script for Timebomb games. Tested and works perfectly on \"Timebomb Duels [Alpha]\" and \"[NEW MAP] TimeBomb AnkleBreak\". \nFully supports mobile devices with draggable on-screen buttons.\n\nFeatures:\n- AI Autopilot: Uses PathfindingService to navigate the map. It automatically jumps over walls, runs away from enemies, and chases them down if you hold the bomb.\n- AI Aimbot: Locks your camera and character onto the nearest player to pass the bomb instantly.\n- Wallhop Macro: Flawless 60-degree camera flick. Press 'K' on PC or use the draggable on-screen button for Mobile.\n- Auto-Flee: Legit evasion system to keep a safe distance from the bomb holder.\n- Visuals: Bomb ESP and Tracers (activates only when players enter the arena).\n- Mobile Support: On-screen toggles for the UI and Wallhop.\n- Misc: Massless Hitbox Expander (won't break physics), Fake Lags, Ice Slider Fix, FOV changer.","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mosinojik/timebomb/refs/heads/main/main.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6751e454535eb7ce4127b4a4","username":"mosinojik","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e4cf5136ead51e488cfb7d68a4b79bc14b6606a0ebe8fd8cc635009f133740b7.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6751e454535eb7ce4127b4a4-1758039601562.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6751e454535eb7ce4127b4a4","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/e4cf5136ead51e488cfb7d68a4b79bc14b6606a0ebe8fd8cc635009f133740b7.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images